# Build-time configuration of the Cone Desktop on Buzz 1.0 (cone-buzz-infra
# slices/48-cone-desktop-on-buzz-app.md decision 6). Loaded by cone/build-env.sh
# into the process environment that `tauri build` (build.rs, the plugin
# manager) and its frontend build (vite.config.ts) read. No secret ever goes in
# this file. An empty value is set on purpose: upstream reads an explicit empty
# value differently from an unset one.

# The community a new install selects once, after identity setup, when the
# person has no saved community (docs/configuration.md).
BUZZ_DEFAULT_COMMUNITY_URL=wss://buzz.cone.digital
# Empty: no Builderlab. Unset would keep Block's built-in sign-in server
# (https://app.builderlab.xyz); empty turns it off, and with it the welcome
# screen's sign-in, hosted communities and key backup.
BUZZ_BUILDERLAB_URL=
# Empty: no native Apps SSO.
BUZZ_BUILDERLAB_APPS_DOMAIN=
# The update feed (decision 6), compiled into every build with the public key
# cone/build-env.sh reads from cone/updater.pub (minisign A11AAB7556EB3BE2, the
# old app's key); with both set build.rs registers the updater. A second path
# beside the old app's /desktop/latest.json: object 2/latest.json in the same
# bucket. A release reaches installed apps only when promoted.
BUZZ_UPDATER_ENDPOINT=https://buzz.cone.digital/desktop/2/latest.json
